<title>USA: Stage Stores Inc Q1 May 3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stage Stores Inc Q1 May 3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.30		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net		 7,094		    2,652</p>
<p> Net sales	 191,512		  163,177</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  23,904		   12,861</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters ended May 3, 1997 and May 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income for the 1996 quarter was $4.9 million and pro forma weighted average shares outstanding totalled 23.6 millon.</p>
<p>Pro forma data assumes intial public offering and related transactions occurred at beginning of the periods presented.</p>
